    "title": "New keys",
    "body": "### Please describe the feature you'd like to see added.\n\nI dont know what keys will work.  Maybe there is a solution.\n\nPlease consider adding signing to wallets with existing private keys so when btc is moved to new address types people with the keys to their btc can sign a message to a multisignature address and get their btc back.\n\nIf there are address types that are more than 256 bits then everything is ok.\n\nPlease use a huge private key for the new address types.  I dont know if pqc will help.\n\nIm dumb.  \nDave\n\n### Is your feature related to a problem, if so please describe it.\n\n_No response_\n\n### Describe the solution you'd like\n\n_No response_\n\n### Describe any alternatives you've considered\n\n_No response_\n\n### Please leave any additional context\n\n_No response_",
